WEBVTT

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.999
And I'm like, this is quite me.

00:06:34.139 --> 00:06:37.028
With all the odds I was up against,

00:06:37.658 --> 00:06:42.349
if I multiply my odd situation,
with my odd behavior ...

00:06:43.029 --> 00:06:45.829
(Laughter)

00:06:46.929 --> 00:06:49.408
(Applause)

00:06:52.888 --> 00:06:53.969
So what happens?

00:06:53.969 --> 00:06:56.830
I get myself into another odd situation.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.709
(Laughter)

00:06:58.709 --> 00:07:05.029
But the magic is, if I multiply
my odd situations with my even behavior,